<!-- ===== AFTER THE SALE: orders, order detail, receipts ===== -->
<section class="eppx-ns eppx-ns--orders ds-night" aria-labelledby="eppx-orders-heading">
  <div class="eppx-ns__grid eppx-ns__grid--orders">
    <div class="eppx-ns__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span class="ds-eyebrow">After the sale</span>
      <h2 id="eppx-orders-heading" class="ds-h2">Every Order, With the <span class="ds-hl-dark">Payment Behind It</span></h2>
      <p class="ds-body">Orders lists each purchase with the buyer, ticket, discount, total and payment status. Open one to see the coupon used, the gateway payment ID, the participants and any refund history, then refund or cancel from the same panel.</p>
      <p class="ds-body">Cancelling can be done with or without a gateway refund, and receipts can be downloaded or emailed to the buyer.</p>
      <a class="ds-btn--ghost eppx-ns__link" href="/event-registration/">See how registration feeds orders</a>
    </div>
    <div class="eppx-ns__media ds-glass-dark animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="80">
      <div class="ds-shot">
        <img src="/feature-images/event-payment-processing/v5/orders.webp" width="2240" height="1530" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          alt="Orders list with 1,018 orders, 36 today, 9 failed and USD 262,100.00 total" />
      </div>
      <div class="ds-shot">
        <img src="/feature-images/event-payment-processing/v5/drawer.webp" width="920" height="1800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          alt="Order detail drawer with grand total USD 307.98, refund history, Refund payment and Cancel order" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== HOLD UNTIL APPROVAL ===== -->
<section class="eppx-ns eppx-ns--hold ds-stage" aria-labelledby="eppx-hold-heading">
  <div class="eppx-ns__grid eppx-ns__grid--hold">
    <div class="eppx-ns__media ds-glass animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <div class="ds-shot">
        <img src="/feature-images/event-payment-processing/v5/finance.webp" width="2240" height="1540" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
          alt="Finance report by order status: Paid, Refunded, Created and Failed with counts and amounts, and US$780.00 pending in the totals" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="eppx-ns__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="80">
      <span class="ds-eyebrow">Approval-led events</span>
      <h2 id="eppx-hold-heading" class="ds-h2">Hold the Payment Until <span class="ds-hl">You Approve the Registration</span></h2>
      <p class="ds-body">For events that review every registration, the buyer's payment is held rather than taken. It is captured when you approve, so you only collect from people you accept. Held payments show as authorized in Finance until then.</p>
      <a class="ds-btn--ghost eppx-ns__link" href="/event-registration/">How approval works in registration</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== GATEWAY RATE ===== -->
<section class="eppx-ns eppx-ns--fees" aria-labelledby="eppx-fees-heading">
  <div class="eppx-ns__grid eppx-ns__grid--fees">
    <div class="eppx-ns__copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <span class="ds-eyebrow">Know your fees</span>
      <h2 id="eppx-fees-heading" class="ds-h2">See the <span class="ds-hl">Gateway Rate</span> Before You Sell</h2>
      <p class="ds-body">Payment Configuration shows the fee note for the payment option you pick and lets you set the gateway percentage, the fixed fee per transaction and the tax on fees, so Finance can estimate your net payout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ds-shot animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp" data-delay="80">
      <img src="/feature-images/event-payment-processing/v5/config.webp" width="2240" height="1220" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
        alt="Payment Configuration with the fee note and Gateway Fee Estimates: Stripe fee 2.9 percent, fixed fee 0.3, tax on fees 0" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

